<title>AUSTRIA: Boehler hits record high on strong leads.</title>
<headline>Boehler hits record high on strong leads.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian high-grade steelmaker Boehler Uddeholm soared in early trade to a record intraday high of 1,020 in an overall bullish Vienna market.</p>
<p>At 0920 GMT Boehler was trading up 2.02 percent or 19.80 schillings at 1,000. It topped turnover at 53,759 lots.</p>
<p>&quot;It's not just Boehler, the whole market is strongly bullish at the moment,&quot; one trader said.</p>
<p>The ATX index was up 1.55 percent at 1,360.67 at 0920 GMT -- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12257</p>
